# Google Maps JavaScript API + Routes API key.
#
# Get one at https://console.cloud.google.com/google/maps-apis:
#   1. Create/select a Google Cloud project with billing enabled.
#   2. Enable "Maps JavaScript API" and "Routes API".
#   3. Create a key, then restrict it (HTTP referrers = your dev/prod domains,
#      API restrictions = the two APIs above only).
#
# Copy this file to ".env" in this same folder and paste the real key there.
# ".env" is read automatically by Vite and must never be committed.
# Without this key, the Route Planner falls back to the OpenStreetMap/Leaflet
# map and illustrative distance-based ETA -- it does not break, it just runs
# without live Google routing.
VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=
